<p>Poland (by rail)	    14,900		1,800	  n/a</p>
<p>CIS deliveries:</p>
<p> Belarus		     2.41 million     288,700	  -0.1</p>
<p> Ukraine		     1.41 million     169,100	 -20.1</p>
<p> Kazakhstan		  600,000	     72,000	 +27.7</p>
<p>--Mike Collett-White, Moscow Newsroom +7095 941 8520</p>
